#  [if SomeGlobal.some_property == true /] ,- check for variables
# use % to create a random percentage they say something
# ~ to make a cue, => to jump to a cue

~ start
while CharacterGlobals.characters["Cookie"].has_met == false:
	Cookie: [rainbow freq=1.0 sat=0.8 val=0.8 speed=1.0]Honk![/rainbow] Nice to meet you![br]
	Cookie: I'm Cookie the Clown, but you can just call me Cookie!
	Cookie: It has been a very long time since I have felt relaxation in a meaningful way.
	set CharacterGlobals.characters["Cookie"].has_met = true
~ nuetral
% Cookie: [rainbow freq=1.0 sat=0.8 val=0.8 speed=1.0]Honk Honk![/rainbow]
% Cookie: I think Sartre liked clowns.
% Cookie: When will the suffering end?
- Who do you think did it?
	Cookie: Maybe it was a cabal?[br]I swear everywhere I look there's cars with 6, sometimes 7 people gettin' out of em.
	Cookie: This world has horrors beyond even my comprehension.
	=> nuetral
- Tell me about yourself.
	Cookie: I no longer feel safe in online spaces. [rainbow freq=1.0 sat=0.8 val=0.8 speed=1.0]Honk![/rainbow]
	=> nuetral
- Do you recognize this item?
	=> items
- What were you doing today?
	match CharacterGlobals.characters["Cookie"].activity:
		when "Fishing"
			Cookie: Well I was [color=crimson]fishing[/color], of course! [rainbow freq=1.0 sat=0.8 val=0.8 speed=1.0]Honk Honk![/rainbow]
			Cookie: Holding their life in my hands makes me feel powerful.
		when "Cooking"
			Cookie: [color=crimson]Cooking[/color]! [rainbow freq=1.0 sat=0.8 val=0.8 speed=1.0]Honk Honk![/rainbow][br]It is an essential skill for all clown kind.
		when "Gardening"
			Cookie: [color=crimson]Gardening[/color]! [rainbow freq=1.0 sat=0.8 val=0.8 speed=1.0]Honk Honk![/rainbow]
			Cookie: Watching things grow serves as a reminder that I too will wilt.
		when "Dressing up"
			Cookie: [color=crimson]Dressing up![/color] [rainbow freq=1.0 sat=0.8 val=0.8 speed=1.0]Honk Honk![/rainbow] Or rather, dressing down.
			Cookie: I weep for the day when I am no longer the clown.
		when ""
			Cookie: Looks like initialization didn't assign me anything.
			Cookie: So nothing, apparently. [rainbow freq=1.0 sat=0.8 val=0.8 speed=1.0]Honk Honk![/rainbow]
	=> nuetral
- Where were you...
	=> timesegments
- Count down once.
	Cookie: I'm counting down.
	do Globals.count_down(1)
	=> nuetral
- That's all.
	=> END

~ timesegments
- Morning
	Cookie: Goofing around in the [color=crimson]{{CharacterGlobals.characters["Cookie"].morning}}[/color].[br]It's the only way to start the day!
	do Globals.count_down(1, "Cookie_morning")
	=> nuetral
- Afternoon
	Cookie: Noon is the silliest time! [rainbow freq=1.0 sat=0.8 val=0.8 speed=1.0]Honk Honk![/rainbow][br] Sorry, that ws out of line. I was in the [color=crimson]{{CharacterGlobals.characters["Cookie"].noon}}[/color].
	do Globals.count_down(1, "Cookie_noon")
	=> nuetral
- Evening
	Cookie: Sleep is sort of like the cousin of death when you look at it like a clown![br]I was in the [color=crimson]{{CharacterGlobals.characters["Cookie"].night}}[/color].
	do Globals.count_down(1, "Cookie_night")
	=> nuetral
- Nevermind
	=> nuetral

~ items
#check the size of the inventory array and use a match case
#did you know toby fox used one giant match case for the entirety of the homsetuck dialogue wow
match Globals.inventory.size()
	when 0
		You don't have anything. Maybe there are things to find in the Manor...?
		- Go back
			=> nuetral

	when 1
		- {{Globals.item1}}
			=> checkitem1
		- No Item [if Globals.item1==""]
		- No Item [if Globals.item1==""]
		- No Item [if Globals.item1==""]
		- Go back
			=> nuetral

	when 2
		- {{Globals.item1}}
			=> checkitem1
		- {{Globals.item2}}
			=> checkitem2
		- No Item [if Globals.item1==""]
		- No Item [if Globals.item1==""]
		- Go back
			=> nuetral

	when 3
		- {{Globals.item1}}
			=> checkitem1
		- {{Globals.item2}}
			=> checkitem2
		- {{Globals.item3}}
			=> checkitem3
		- No Item [if Globals.item1==""]
		- Go back
			=> nuetral

	when 4
		- {{Globals.item1}}
			=> checkitem1
		- {{Globals.item2}}
			=> checkitem2
		- {{Globals.item3}}
			=> checkitem3
		- {{Globals.item4}}
			=> checkitem4
		- Go back
			=> nuetral

=> nuetral

~ checkitem1
if Globals.item1 == CharacterGlobals.characters["Cookie"].item:
	Cookie: What even is ownership? [rainbow freq=1.0 sat=0.8 val=0.8 speed=1.0]Honk Honk![/rainbow][br]Yes, that's mine.
else
	Cookie: Whomp Whomp. Huge loser moment! Not even close!
=> nuetral

~ checkitem2
if Globals.item2 == CharacterGlobals.characters["Cookie"].item:
	Cookie: What even is ownership? [rainbow freq=1.0 sat=0.8 val=0.8 speed=1.0]Honk Honk![/rainbow][br]Yes, that's mine.
else
	Cookie: Whomp Whomp. Huge loser moment! Not even close!
=> nuetral

~ checkitem3
if Globals.item3 == CharacterGlobals.characters["Cookie"].item:
	Cookie: What even is ownership? [rainbow freq=1.0 sat=0.8 val=0.8 speed=1.0]Honk Honk![/rainbow][br]Yes, that's mine.
else
	Cookie: Whomp Whomp. Huge loser moment! Not even close!
=> nuetral

~ checkitem4
if Globals.item4 == CharacterGlobals.characters["Cookie"].item:
	Cookie: What even is ownership? [rainbow freq=1.0 sat=0.8 val=0.8 speed=1.0]Honk Honk![/rainbow][br]Yes, that's mine.
else
	Cookie: Whomp Whomp. Huge loser moment! Not even close!
=> nuetral